            "answer_1": "<p>The AirVacuum Kit compresses 15+ clothing items to save up to 60% space in any travel bag, no check-in required. Designed for carry-on efficiency, each modular bag is made from durable, anti-rip nylon with waterproof, odor-proof seals to keep clothes clean and fresh on the move.</p><p>Use the portable Air Pump for easy compression anywhere, or connect any vacuum cleaner for maximum speed at home. Whether you're packing for a weekend or two weeks, Aerless™ helps you travel lighter, faster, and smarter<br/><br/>Dimensions: 12 x 19 x 4 inches (30cm x 48cm x 10cm)</p>",
